Recommends:
 amneziawg-archive-keyring,
Description: AmneziaWG kernel module (DKMS source)
 AmneziaWG is a VPN protocol that is based on WireGuard. It adds
 obfuscation of the packet headers and junk packets.
 .
 This package contains the source of the amneziawg kernel module.
 DKMS builds the module for each installed kernel. You must install the
 kernel headers that agree with each kernel.
